[{"id":"d05-init-failure-cleanup","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Agent Harness","tags":["Agent Harness","测试开发"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(五)插件与资源.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(五)插件与资源","articlePath":"posts/36d0b733/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/agent-harness/Agent Harness(五)插件与资源.md","articleTitle":"Agent Harness(五)插件与资源","articlePath":"posts/36d0b733/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":1,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>当“初始化失败清理”出现时，先检查哪个状态和边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先把“初始化失败清理”绑定到load与owner；正常、越界和 Unknown 各运行一次，断言失败也执行。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>在cleanup夹具中，比较清单与依赖与连接、监听器、后台任务，保留失败也执行；初始化失败不是“没有资源”；清理路径必须在异常和取消中运行。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-L2-009","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["广播域","交换机"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":15,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>冲突域和广播域有什么区别？交换机、Hub、VLAN 和路由器分别影响哪个边界？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>冲突域关注共享介质上的同时发送和碰撞，广播域关注二层广播的传播范围；Hub 共享冲突域，交换机端口通常隔离冲突，VLAN 切分广播域，路由器三层接口通常隔离广播。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>冲突域是可能互相争用同一介质、产生二层碰撞的范围；广播域是广播帧会被泛洪到的范围。Hub 让端口共享一个冲突域，交换机通常把每个端口分开，VLAN 则把广播域分段；路由器默认不转发二层广播，因此隔开广播域。现代全双工链路很少出现经典碰撞，仍应结合双工、接口错误、VLAN 和环路状态验证，不能只背口诀。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>设备或配置\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>对冲突域的影响\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>对广播域的影响\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Hub\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>多端口共享\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常仍在同一广播域\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>交换机端口\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常一端口一个\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不跨 VLAN\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>VLAN\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>通常不直接改变\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>每个 VLAN 独立\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>路由器\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>由接口分隔\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>默认不转发二层广播\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-TR-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["UDP","首部"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(四)UDP 与 TCP","articlePath":"posts/ec8f5dd0/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":19,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>UDP 首部有哪些固定字段？它为什么不能单独提供 TCP 式可靠字节流？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>源端口、目的端口、长度和校验和；它没有序列号、确认号、重传、排序和拥塞控制状态。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>UDP 保留数据报边界并把可靠性决策交给应用或上层协议。QUIC 说明“跑在 UDP 上”不等于协议整体没有连接、加密或可靠流机制。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>先看协议提供的边界，再讨论性能：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>能力\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>UDP\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>TCP\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>数据报边界\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>保留\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>不保留，只有字节流\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>重传/排序\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用决定\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>协议提供\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>拥塞控制\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>应用或上层决定\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>协议提供\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>UDP 少的是机制，不是“更快”的保证；如果应用补回可靠性、加密和拥塞控制，比较对象就已经变成完整协议栈。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-api-seed","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["APIRequestContext","测试数据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>什么时候用 API 准备数据，什么时候必须走 UI？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>前置数据用 API，被测用户旅程使用 UI。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>创建大量历史订单只是准备条件，可由 API 高效完成；买家提交订单若是被测行为，就必须通过 UI 执行，并结合页面或 API 验证结果。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>准备数据和验证用户行为可以分开：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">api.create_order(status=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;draft&quot;\u003c/span>)       \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 快速准备前置状态\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;button&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;提交&quot;\u003c/span>).click()  \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 被测行为走 UI\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">api.get_order(order_id)                \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 需要时从服务端核验结果\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>API 适合高效造数和清理；用户真正要完成的旅程仍应由 UI 驱动，否则测试没有覆盖页面与交互合同。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-xdist-dist-modes","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["调度"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性","articlePath":"posts/5497f9c8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十)并行执行与稳定性","articlePath":"posts/5497f9c8/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>xdist 的调度模式按什么粒度分组？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>load 按节点均衡，loadscope/loadfile 按类模块或文件聚合，loadgroup 按显式组标记，worksteal 在 worker 空闲时动态窃取。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>调度器只决定节点怎样分发，不会替测试设计资源隔离：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>模式\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>聚合粒度\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>适合场景\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>load\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>单个 Node\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>任务差异大，优先均衡\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>loadscope\u003c/code> / \u003ccode>loadfile\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>类、模块或文件\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>同一资源不能跨 worker\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>loadgroup\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>显式组\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>自定义共享边界\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>\u003ccode>worksteal\u003c/code>\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>空闲 worker 动态取任务\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>长短任务混合\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>先按固定文件、端口或数据库键的共享边界选模式，再观察耗时分布；模式改变不了资源命名，也不能自动消除并发冲突。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-junit-vs-allure","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["报告格式"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/51d93cec/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(十一)覆盖率与测试报告","articlePath":"posts/51d93cec/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>JUnit XML 与 Allure 分别服务什么消费者？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>JUnit XML 是 CI 读取的机器结果交换格式；Allure 是面向人工诊断的步骤、标签和附件报告。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>两者的消费路径不同，产物也不应互相替代：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>产物\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>主要消费者\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>关注点\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>JUnit XML\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>CI、测试平台\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>稳定字段、状态、耗时、退出结果\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>Allure 结果\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>开发者和诊断者\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>步骤、标签、附件、可视化关联\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>JUnit 的机器可读不代表安全，Allure 的漂亮页面也不代表完整。上传前仍要检查 XML、结果目录、附件权限和保留策略，并为两种产物分别保留失败时的文字兜底。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]